<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung targets 85 trln won sales.</title>
<headline>Samsung targets 85 trln won sales.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Group said on Monday it has set a sales target of 85 trillion won this year against an estimated 74 trillion won last year.</p>
</text>
